WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.445 --> 00:00:02.812
- I was a weird kid, and
I wanted the popular girls

00:00:02.812 --> 00:00:04.671
to accept me into their
group, and I thought having

00:00:04.671 --> 00:00:06.690
a screen name like this would
trick them into thinking

00:00:06.690 --> 00:00:08.385
I was one of them.

00:00:11.794 --> 00:00:14.209
- When I was 13, John Cena
was my favorite wrestler,

00:00:14.209 --> 00:00:15.788
and he called his fans "The Chain Gang"

00:00:15.788 --> 00:00:19.107
and me being 13 at the time,
had to add a 69 at the end.

00:00:19.107 --> 00:00:20.194
(laughing)
(beep)

00:00:20.194 --> 00:00:22.005
- I mean what else can
you expect from a person

00:00:22.005 --> 00:00:24.025
who wears her name in hoop earrings?

00:00:24.025 --> 00:00:26.464
Cause I'm Cuban, and proud.

00:00:26.464 --> 00:00:28.275
Fresh out of the Quinceañera stage.

00:00:28.275 --> 00:00:32.964
- So I chose HairyJ69, when
I was 18 and in college

00:00:32.964 --> 00:00:37.028
because I'm hairy,
extremely hairy, I'm Jewish,

00:00:38.318 --> 00:00:40.140
and I like to 69.

00:00:40.140 --> 00:00:41.242
I chose this screen name,

00:00:41.242 --> 00:00:43.254
because I wanted to live in California.

00:00:43.254 --> 00:00:44.392
I thought that's where all the pretty

00:00:44.392 --> 00:00:46.087
and popular people lived.

00:00:46.087 --> 00:00:48.339
Clearly I wasn't much of a speller.

00:00:49.454 --> 00:00:51.567
- This is genius all
right, when you're scanning

00:00:51.567 --> 00:00:53.750
your friends list, you wonder who's on,

00:00:53.750 --> 00:00:54.979
and then when you see that I'm on,

00:00:54.979 --> 00:00:57.371
you're like, "hey, Ryan in on."

00:00:57.371 --> 00:00:59.508
I added the X because
I forgot my password.

00:00:59.508 --> 00:01:01.039
I'm pretty proud of it actually.

00:01:01.039 --> 00:01:03.559
- [Voiceover] That never
occurred to you Ryan is on "X" ?

00:01:04.579 --> 00:01:09.479
- Oh (beep) (laughs) No
that never occurred to me.

00:01:09.479 --> 00:01:10.408
Oh my god.

00:01:10.408 --> 00:01:12.846
You threw me off, man I'm like...

00:01:14.634 --> 00:01:16.757
(laughs)

00:01:16.757 --> 00:01:18.756
You ruined it, (beep).

00:01:18.756 --> 00:01:21.636
- I chose this name name when
I was about 13 years old.

00:01:21.636 --> 00:01:24.887
Stay hooded, because I
thought I would stay ghetto.

00:01:24.887 --> 00:01:26.396
